祖母陳太妃以為不祥，毀而賣之。占者以金是晉行大興之祥，覃為皇胤，是其瑞也。毀而賣之，象覃見廢不終之驗也。永嘉初，前北軍中候任城呂雍、度支校尉陳顏等謀立覃為太子，事覺，幽于金墉城。未幾，被害，時年十四，葬以庶人禮。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"acquisition":"current_rendered_tool_text","reported_revision_id":2622004,"fixed_body_obtained":false,"tool_line":192},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014:m0001","start":1,"end":4,"surface":"沖太孫","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAAAC","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"shang"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014:m0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"齊王冏","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIBD","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"jiong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014:m0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"漢成","kind":"person","person_id":"1r1_4hp_csg","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"hancheng"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014:m0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"定陶","kind":"person","person_id":"fst_enp_ln8","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"han_aidi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014:m0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"孝和","kind":"person","person_id":"3e7_rht_k5z","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"hanhe"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014:m0102","start":102,"end":103,"surface":"安","kind":"person","person_id":"7zd_hi5_fwe","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"hanan"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014:m0121","start":121,"end":125,"surface":"清河王覃","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAFA","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"qin"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014:m0135","start":135,"end":137,"surface":"康王","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAF","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"xia"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014:m0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"周氏","kind":"person","person_id":"7c9_e07_973_A","status"